  "description": "RUHPAP crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C124 H106 N6 O24 Tm4. From the CIF bond table, Tm1 (Tm) has 6 O neighbors; Tm2 (Tm) has 8 O neighbors; Tm3 (Tm) has 6 O neighbors; Tm4 (Tm) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 3 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a chain with approximately linear metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.740-3.753 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 106.60-114.94°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Tm4(dbm)6(L)2(μ2-OCH3)2(CH3OH)2] (C124H106Tm4N6O24).",
